<title>USA: Motivepower expects to reach 97 EPS target.</title>
<headline>Motivepower expects to reach 97 EPS target.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>MotivePower Industries Inc said Thursday that it believes it can achieve its earnings target of $0.71 for the year.</p>
<p>&quot;With our existing order book continuing to be strong and other near-term prospects looking favorable, we are very optimistic that we can at least achieve our earnings per share target of $0.71 for the year,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
</text>
